{"product_id":"chanakyas-chant","title":"Chanakya's Chant","description":"\u003cp\u003eCold, calculating, cruel and armed with a complete absence of accepted morals, he becomes the most powerful political strategist in Bharat and succeeds in uniting a ragged country against the invasion of the army of that demigod, Alexander the great. Pitting the weak edges of both forces against each other, he pulls off a wicked and astonishing victory and succeed in installing Chandragupta on the throne of the mighty Mauryan empire. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 180  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Ashwin Sanghi \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9789380658674 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 468\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43456767393945,"sku":"17RB-2-9789380658674","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/chanakyas-chant-478224.jpg?v=1696127395","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/chanakyas-chant","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}